I’m sorry—since I can’t see or change your account here, I’ll need a human agent to check whether your payment can be stopped or reversed in time. Please contact ACME Bank support and have these details ready:
1) Your {{Bank Name}} and {{Account Number}}
2) The {{Transaction Date}} (yesterday) and {{Transaction Amount}}
3) Any {{Transaction ID}} or the recipient name
4) What you want to do (cancel/recall/replace the payment)

A human agent will review the transfer status and advise the fastest option for your rent payment.
